name pst-pulley
category Package
revision 62977
shortdesc Plot pulleys, using PSTricks
longdesc The package enables the user to draw pulley systems with up to
longdesc 6 pulleys. The pulley diagrams are labelled with the physical
longdesc properties of the system. The package uses pstricks and
longdesc requires several PSTricks-related packages.
